        <mxCell id="p7_c43" value="Akış: 1) OTP iste (/api/web/otp → /janus/otp/request → SmsOtpCGW)  2) giriş (/api/web/login → /janus/login-user → CGW → API → ACL → LegacyDB)  3) client token  4) işlem (/api/transaction → /janus/transaction → channel-gateway → monolit). Lab: SMS kodu yanıtta değil /sms sayfasında." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1f1f1f;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="1820" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
